      "message": "Done. Some explanation about current code.\n\n- Changed to use `static` with `lazy_static`: `const` didn\u0027t work well. `const` only allows stack memory and `const fn`, so keeping values `const` required lots of extra codes and didn\u0027t look clean. See: go/paste/4921370537361408. There\u0027s external crates for the purpose, but none of them are available in Android.\n\n- Added new `struct DPPath` to keep two `\u0026CStr`\n  - Changed from tuple to add name and convenient method.\n  - Keep `\u0026CStr` to validate whether params are valid `CStr` as early as possible.",
